 "provenance": "Angkor 5 (w0 l4) normal exit, start values of the old campaign chain (lives 7, campaign diamonds 37, maxHealth 4, weaponTier 1 = hammer from Angkor 4). Replays the intent of the old port route (routes/angkor-05-normal.json) with repairs on the exact core: passes the red-snake pit down column 9 instead of dying to it (no reset needed); presses the plate at 40,20 by dropping the four row-17 stones and pushing the 34,18 stone along row 18 onto it; collects the six diamonds released by the brick row at 38-43,6 without being crushed; kills the combat-room red snake by cutting the grass under the 25,3 stone as it passes (the hammer is not usable on the checkpoint cell and a hit makes the red snake chase the hero), then walks around the stone. Control-only.",
